# 9/2 加的補救：networkd 重啟時，規則會被清掉；10 秒後重啟 wg-portal，讓它把規則加回來
[Unit]
Description=Restart wg-portal 10s after systemd-networkd restarts
After=systemd-networkd.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/bin/sh -c 'sleep 10; systemctl restart wg-portal.service'

[Install]
WantedBy=systemd-networkd.service
